#: cghanafuda/koikoi-game.c:1114
msgid ""
"Match a card from your hand to one of the same month on the field,\n"
"then turn a card from the stock and do the same. Cards matched are yours.\n"
"With a yaku, stop and take its points, or call koi-koi and play on.\n"
